<title>高雄市長候選人造勢！台下僅8人仍講完68分鐘　辛酸影片讓網喊佩服</title>

<link rel="canonical" itemprop="mainEntityOfPage" href="https://www.ettoday.net/news/20261106/3267823.htm"/>

